gothic   \" id=\"SE-afc3e835-73dc-4031-bb4d-592f07d75fc3\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0fb20cd2-df8a-4feb-ae0d-0c81ae45bdbd\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-88cdc72f-645e-4580-869d-cede6fb1710b\">게임을 완전히 종료하신 후 재접속하여</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0a81a6af-3c48-4911-b812-375fc129be8d\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-4cdcf510-3515-4602-8962-6ba8bdbaa0dd\">업데이트 리소스를 다운로드해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-995816cb-e57d-42fb-9205-184bb1e1ea18\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b09838a0-f2ae-49f9-b4a2-4bad0b51aeed\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f3e4b136-437c-4b0a-ad36-caf3dff378d3\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-8a2ffa2e-73ec-4b29-a02a-501610d74771\">자세한 내용은 아래를 확인 부탁드립니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b3dfb517-86e8-47bb-a3dd-557d8b99dcf9\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-9d26dd58-6c45-4532-a68e-23424201a541\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d34ce91f-7162-408b-9647-45e39474b4c6\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-70cda737-bfea-46da-9fd2-4d8b0ed7be41\">·····················································································</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fe8fd937-769c-43d9-987e-0cb53f63ebdd\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a415be7e-0e8f-445e-835b-eb99d1e5e741\"><b>📢 8/23(일) 무점검 업데이트 안내</b></span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-970454a7-ee2e-4151-8ead-f8bc3066ef28\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b3097197-780f-49b7-882b-89dea4f5fc1c\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-23c5beb1-aaaf-40a7-91fb-0fbd579005ba\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-05bd063d-253a-4542-a0b8-e38db6a4518c\"><b>✔️ 일시</b></span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1d70c570-3c35-49df-a7bf-b457de5e1b0b\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-23d106db-13ee-4497-90e3-5fb666661efe\">- 8/23(일) 20:00 ~ 22:00 경</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ffc1a937-4f0a-4fd4-a04a-0f922f6b4741\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-66b61a03-9c6e-4c9d-b635-b9f316ddde29\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ec1138a7-654b-460f-b607-218716e36ce1\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-bba1b6cb-d5ba-4c5d-a4ad-3729f7514e54\"><b>✔️ 내용</b></span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-120147ff-1cf4-42da-99a5-45ea4af6633a\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-45e8e357-452b-42cf-b81e-ce804219dd80\">1. 특정 환경에서 퀸(니지마 마코토)과 야마기 유키코의 버스트 스킬을 사용할 때 [1more] 버프가 정상적으로 발동하지 않는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2e03a89d-451e-4a39-99c4-e97048792b1d\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-723bf608-37b3-4b11-9f23-b62ac30e8940\">└ 거듭 불편을 드리게 된 점 깊이 사과드리며, 지휘관 여러분께 보상으로 (스킬 매뉴얼 상자 * 5, 버스트 매뉴얼 상자 * 5, 관리 키트 상자 II * 24, 큐브 배터리 무작위 보상 * 18)을 지급해 드립니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-35600bf2-a635-471f-b9b2-16815e37a008\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b41b49b3-6b50-4598-b593-b29c4a310e60\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0b4fb3f5-e50b-426c-83f2-5db4599cd19a\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b0775700-b14c-491c-b487-d4144cfb71a3\">※ 게임 재접속 후 업데이트 리소스 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e70bf0a0-d8c2-4996-ab5c-fe0efe49bd74\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e3d726b6-ffde-4d51-bbd9-ed769f8b9ffa\">※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6f46ad71-7750-411f-989e-32051f14cd6c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-04a0c222-c399-4930-a517-62e227fe6ce1\">·····················································································</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9c298690-2493-42b8-bcd2-48b926998097\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e9d54a06-8f38-49e6-986c-d022a44c2809\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a5f8cd2a-bf54-4261-bc62-eb0db6dae745\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-0c768247-a7ed-4115-b766-577a42c5e42f\">게임 이용에 불편을 드린 점 깊이 사과드립니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_text\", \"id\": \"SE-27d2653b-ea40-49a7-ab36-47b9264d211b\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"text\"  }}'></script>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-65e16399-c492-4f6e-9fbb-6b7098be4e0e\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"max-width:100px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-65e16399-c492-4f6e-9fbb-6b7098be4e0e\", \"src\" : \"https://nng-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjA4MjNfMjY5/MDAxNzg3NDkwNTQ5MjU0.5GaTn8OromVBAb9kHuMq_a5GRzfIhr6DhFaSx2nWuDsg.JL_fHRgr0mgoq6wkJYsCIEC6nMFAJg7ht3TPnom69sog.PNG/241030_%EC%97%85%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B8_100x100.png?type=w1678\", \"originalWidth\" : \"100\", \"originalHeight\" : \"100\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\", \"fileSize\": \"19573\" }'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://nng-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjA4MjNfMjY5/MDAxNzg3NDkwNTQ5MjU0.5GaTn8OromVBAb9kHuMq_a5GRzfIhr6DhFaSx2nWuDsg.JL_fHRgr0mgoq6wkJYsCIEC6nMFAJg7ht3TPnom69sog.PNG/241030_%EC%97%85%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B8_100x100.png?typ